# Menace (CR 702.111a): Kirk can't be blocked except by two or more creatures. On turn 5 Kirk attacks while Bot2 controls a
# Grizzly Bears and a Memnite: the lone Bears block is refused, and the two together block him, dealing him 3 in combat so
# he dies and Bot2 takes no damage. Kirk's 4 power alone is short of 8, so no card is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Kirk, Enterprising Captain
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Memnite
Island x16

